Package: SystemCondtions
Type: project
Title: Everglades System Conditions Report
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Paul", "Julian", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "you@example.com")
Description: Daily automated report aggregating hydrologic, water quality,
    and harmful algal bloom conditions across Lake Okeechobee, the Northern
    Estuaries, and the Greater Everglades from USACE, SFWMD, FWC, USGS, and
    NOAA data sources. This DESCRIPTION exists for dependency management
    (pak / r-lib actions), not for building an installable package.
